Audit the page below against these checks. Return a table with columns: Check, Result (Pass or Violation), Location, Fix.\par
\par
1. The H1 and title tag share one macro context.\par
2. The first sentence under every heading is a direct, certain answer.\par
3. No hedging words: will, should, might, could, may, probably, appears to, can help.\par
4. Every count is a numeral and the items follow immediately.\par
5. Every number is a user input, a formula result, or appears in the DATA block. List any that do not.\par
6. Conditions come after the statement in every if-sentence.\par
7. Headings are questions, except hub and table headings.\par
