2. Any surface with a null price is hidden and listed under Price data not loaded. Any surface with a null lifespan hides only its cost-per-year column. A production build fails if a displayed value is null.\par
3. UI: inputs on the left; a results table on the right (stacked on mobile) with one row per surface, a sort toggle (upfront cost or cost per year), and the selected-surface radio button. Assumptions sit under the table.\par
